WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.868
-And finally,
have you guys noticed

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.167
that when you start
typing something on Google,

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.901
it automatically tries to
complete the search for you?

00:00:05.901 --> 00:00:08.434
It autofills
what you're looking for?

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:10.234
Sometimes their suggestions
are a little off.

00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:12.901
I'll show you what I mean.
It's time for Google Autofails.

00:00:12.901 --> 00:00:16.667
-♪ Google autofails ♪

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:18.167
♪ Yeah ♪

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:20.167
-Just look at what I did today.

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:22.434
I typed in
"How did Yellowstone..."

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:24.467
and these three things
popped up.

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:26.200
"season 4 end?"

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.067
"get so popular?"

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.367
"convince my dad
to start dressing

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:30.734
like Woody from Toy Story?"

00:00:30.734 --> 00:00:31.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:31.734 --> 00:00:34.300
He works in an office!

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.934
Here's another one.

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.767
I typed in
"Why is Joe Burrow..."

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:40.367
It said "so good,"

00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:41.901
"number 9,"

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:43.133
"in my wife's search history?"

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:45.267
[ Applause ]

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:48.167
-Wait, what?

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:49.400
-Next up, I typed in,

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.734
"How to return" and it said,

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:53.267
"a package to Amazon,"

00:00:53.267 --> 00:00:54.801
"cable equipment to Spectrum,"

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:58.767
"Prince Harry to England."

00:00:58.767 --> 00:01:01.334
They --

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:03.067
-That's not you.
That's an autofill.

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:04.801
-After that, I typed in,

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:07.200
"Why can't I sleep?"
and it said,

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.534
"through the night,"

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:09.968
"on my back,"

00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:12.501
"without scrolling through
TikTok for three hours first?"

00:01:12.501 --> 00:01:14.467
"I'll just check it,
just real quick.

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:17.167
I'll just --" Pretty good.

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:19.701
Next up, I typed in
"Whatever happened to..."

00:01:19.701 --> 00:01:21.601
it said "Amelia Earhart,"

00:01:21.601 --> 00:01:23.033
"Susan Boyle,"

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:27.100
"Predictability? The milkman,
the paperboy, evening TV."

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:30.567
[ Applause ]

00:01:30.567 --> 00:01:32.100
After that, I typed in

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:33.400
"How to survive..."

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.000
It said "a tornado,"

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.400
"a hurricane,"

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.067
"a fight in the bathroom
with Marjorie Taylor Greene?"

00:01:39.067 --> 00:01:40.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.501 --> 00:01:43.300
I don't know.
How do you do it?

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:44.534
Next up, I typed in

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:46.767
"Why do the Girl Scouts..."
and it said,

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:48.601
"sell cookies?"

00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:49.801
"wear sashes?"

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:51.501
"guard the entrance
to the grocery store

00:01:51.501 --> 00:01:54.367
like they're
the National Guard?"

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:55.934
You going somewhere?

00:01:55.934 --> 00:01:59.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:00.834
-And finally, I typed in,

00:02:00.834 --> 00:02:02.133
"Am I the only one without..."

00:02:02.133 --> 00:02:03.801
and it said, "a 401k?"

00:02:03.801 --> 00:02:05.501
"a car?"

00:02:05.501 --> 00:02:07.334
"classified documents
in my garage?"

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:09.467
That's all for Google Autofails.

